{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00235","headline":"唐明堂乐章 宫音 · 则天皇后","name":"唐明堂乐章 宫音","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"履艮包羣望，居中冠百灵。\n万方资广运，庶品荷财成。\n神功谅匪测，盛德实难名。\n藻奠申诚敬，恭祀表惟馨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"则天皇后","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}